  "final_text": "The September Racine work order is **WO-2025-09-004** (**MO-25-09-1070**, Cooler Plate Pack). Its component-issue transaction **TXN-ISSUE-250930-1070** was for **$318,250.75** (**31,825,075 cents**).\n\n- **Event created:** 2025-09-30T20:25:00  \n- **September period entered Pending Close:** 2025-09-30T18:00:00  \n- **Time after Pending Close:** **145 minutes**  \n- **Recorded accounting status:** **POSTED**\n\n**Conclusion:** The recorded status is **not consistent** with Oracle’s documented Pending Close treatment. The event is an INPUT/component-issue transaction created after Pending Close; the policy says newly created transactions for the current or a prior period are not processed while the period is Pending Close. The listed exceptions do not apply to this event. The review was read-only.",
